9</span><span class="tf-cg-product-qty font-caption-m">×1</span></div></div></div><div class="tf-cg-entry-item"><div class="tf-cg-entry-content"><div class="tf-cg-entry-title font-body-m">推荐配件</div><div class="tf-cg-entry-subtitle font-caption-m">查看相关配件</div></div><svg class="tf-cg-entry-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M6 4L10 8L6 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="tf-cg-sheet-footer"><div class="tf-cg-footer-total"><span class="tf-cg-total-label font-body-m">合计：</span><span class="tf-cg-total-amount font-headline-m">¥21,999</span></div><button class="tf-cg-primary-btn font-headline-s">去配单</button></div></div></div></div><div class="tf-component-frame" data-component-frame="overlay_mask_2" style="position:fixed;left:0px;top:0px;width:360px;height:100vh;z-index:65"><div data-component-id="overlay_mask_2" class="tf-cg-overlay" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:360px;height:1200px;z-index:65;background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)"></div></div><div class="tf-component-frame" data-component-frame="edit_sheet" style="position:fixed;left:0px;bottom:0px;width:360px;height:420px;z-index:70"><div data-component-id="edit_sheet" class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-root" style="z-index:70"><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-mask"></div><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-sheet"><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-header"><span class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-title font-headline-s">编辑配单信息</span><button class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-close" aria-label="关闭"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5 5L15 15M15 5L5 15" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-body"><label class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-label font-body-m">配单名称</label><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-input-wrap"><input type="text" class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-input font-body-m tf-cg-bottomsheet-input--disabled" placeholder="请输入配单名称" disabled="" value="默认配单方案"/></div></div><div class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-footer"><button class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-btn-primary tf-cg-bottomsheet-btn-primary--loading font-headline-s" disabled=""><svg class="tf-cg-bottomsheet-spinner" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M14 8a6 6 0 0 0-6-6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>提交中...</button></div></div></div></div></section><section id="tf-state-6" class="tf-state-layer tf-llm-layer" style="display:none"><div class="tf-component-frame" data-component-frame="top_nav_config" style="position:absolute;left:0px;top:36px;width:360px;height:56px;z-index:0"><div data-component-id="top_nav_config" style="position:absolute;top:36px;left:0;width:360px;height:56px"><div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-shrink-0" style="height:56px;padding:0 var(--spacing-xl)"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0" style="gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><button class="flex items-center justify-center bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0" style="width:24px;height:40px;color:var(--color-text-primary)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-left:-4px"><path d="M15 19L8 12L15 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div class="min-w-0"><div class="font-headline-xxl truncate" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">配单详情</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center" style="gap:5px"></div></div></div></div><div class="tf-flow-group" data-flow-group="config_content" style="position:absolute;left:0px;top:104px;width:100%;padding:0 12px 96px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;box-sizing:border-box"><div data-component-id="config_overview_card"><div class="bg-white rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] flex flex-col" style="padding:var(--spacing-lg);gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-s" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">配单概览</span><div class="flex items-center"><span class="font-headline-xs" style="color:var(--color-primary);cursor:pointer">编辑</span></div></div><div class="tf-cg-overview-body"><span data-component-id="config_name" class="font-headline-s tf-cg-text" style="font-size:var(--font-headline-16);line-height:var(--line-height-24);font-weight:var(--font-weight-bold);color:var(--color-text-primary)">默认配单方案</span><span data-component-id="config_customer" class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-text-secondary)">客户类型：中小企业</span><div data-component-id="config_prices" class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-primary)">总报价：¥21,999.00 | 总成本价：¥18,500.00</div></div></div></div><div data-component-id="risk_warning_card"><div class="bg-white rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] flex flex-col" style="padding:var(--spacing-lg);gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-s" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">风险提示</span></div><div class="tf-cg-risk-content"><div data-component-id="risk_text"><span class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-warning)">当前方案可能缺少 UPS、路由器、防火墙等关键设备，建议补充以保障系统稳定性。</span></div><div data-component-id="risk_action"><button class="inline-flex items-center bg-transparent border-none tap-scale font-headline-xs " style="gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-xs) 0;color:var(--color-primary);cursor:pointer">去添加 &gt;</button></div></div></div></div><div data-component-id="product_list_card"><div class="bg-white rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] flex flex-col" style="padding:var(--spacing-lg);gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-s" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">产品清单</span><div class="flex items-center"><span class="font-headline-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);cursor:pointer">编辑</span></div></div><div data-component-id="list_item_1"><div><div class="flex active:scale-[0.99] transition-transform duration-150 cursor-pointer" style="height:46px;align-items:flex-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0" style="margin-top:var(--spacing-xs);margin-right:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="width:42px;height:42px;background-color:var(--color-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-md)"><span class="font-headline-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-white);line-height:1;font-size:17.64px">H</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between" style="flex:1;min-width:0;height:46px"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-xs truncate" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">IdeaHub B2 Base-75寸</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 flex" style="gap:var(--spacing-md);margin-left:auto"><button style="width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--color-text-muted);background:transparent;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;padding:0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 3 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M20 7H4"></path><path d="m8 21-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg></button><div class="relative"><button style="width:24px;height:24px;color:var(--color-text-muted);background:transparent;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;padding:0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ellipsis" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="flex items-end justify-between"><span class="font-caption-s rounded-[var(--radius-full)] flex-shrink-0" style="color:var(--color-warning);background-color:rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);padding:1px 8px">谈单中</span><span class="font-caption-s truncate" style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-left:auto">数量: 1 | 单价: ¥21,999</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-component-id="feature_card"><div class="bg-white rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] flex flex-col" style="padding:var(--spacing-lg);gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-s" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">方案特色</span><div class="flex items-center"><span class="tf-cg-add-action font-headline-xs" style="color:var(--color-primary);cursor:pointer">添加</span></div></div><div data-component-id="feature_text"><span class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-text-secondary)">暂无方案特色内容，请添加以向客户展示方案优势。</span></div></div></div><div data-component-id="service_card"><div class="bg-white rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] flex flex-col" style="padding:var(--spacing-lg);gap:var(--spacing-lg)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-headline-s" style="color:var(--color-text-primary)">服务商信息</span></div><div class="tf-cg-service-info-body" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-md)"><div data-component-id="service_provider"><span class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-text-primary)">服务商：华为政企授权服务中心</span></div><div data-component-id="service_contact"><span class="font-body-m" style="font-size:var(--font-body-14);line-height:var(--line-height-20);color:var(--color-text-secondary)">联系人：张经理 | 电话：400-888-9999</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tf-component-frame" data-component-frame="bottom_action_bar_config" style="position:fixed;left:0px;bottom:0px;width:360px;height:64px;z-index:50"><div data-component-id="bottom_action_bar_config" class="tf-cg-bottom-bar" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:1036px;width:360px;height:64px;z-index:50"><div class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__inner"><div class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__left"><button class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action" type="button"><span class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 110-5 2.5 2.5 0 010 5z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action-label">点位图</span></button><button class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action" type="button"><span class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18l4-4h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 14H5.17L4 17.17V4h16v12z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M7 9h10v2H7V9zm0-3h10v2H7V6z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__action-label">采购咨询</span></button></div><div class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__right"><button class="tf-cg-bottom-bar__primary" type="button">导出</button></div></div></div></div></section></div>
<style id="tf-llm-base-style">
.tf-state-layer{position:fixed!important;left:0!important;top:0!important;width:360px!important;height:100vh!important;z-index:9999!important;background:#f5f5f5;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;padding-bottom:88px}
.tf-llm-layer *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tf-keep-placeholder{position:absolute;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:0!important}
.tf-keep-placeholder>.tf-keep-crop{position:absolute;pointer-events:none}
.tf-component-frame{position:absolute;box-sizing:border-box}
/* Frames and flow groups are layout wrappers, not interactive surfaces. An
   LLM-authored wrapper frame left around a runner re-framed fixed component
   (keyboard, bottom bar) is a transparent box floating over the page; if it
   took pointer events it would swallow clicks meant for components beneath it.
   Children re-enable pointer events, and bindings on frames still fire through
   bubbling from those children. */
.tf-llm-layer .tf-component-frame,.tf-llm-layer .tf-flow-group{pointer-events:none}
.tf-llm-layer .tf-component-frame>*,.tf-llm-layer .tf-flow-group>*{pointer-events:auto}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id]{position:relative!important;left:auto!important;top:auto!important;width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;height:100%!important;box-sizing:border-box;z-index:auto!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="keyboard"],.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="Keyboard"],.tf-component-frame>.tf-cg-keyboard{position:absolute!important;left:0!important;right:0!important;top:0!important;bottom:0!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;max-width:100%!important}
.tf-state-layer>[data-component-id*="keyboard"],.tf-state-layer>[data-component-id*="Keyboard"],.tf-state-layer>.tf-cg-keyboard{position:fixed!important;left:0!important;right:0!important;bottom:0!important;top:auto!important;width:100%!important;z-index:150!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"].tf-cg-sheet-overlay{background:transparent!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]>.tf-cg-mask,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-mask,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]>.tf-cg-sheet-mask,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet-mask{display:none!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]>[style*="color-mask"],.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]>[class*="mask"]{display:none!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]{overflow:hidden!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet-container,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet-panel,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-bottom-sheet,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"]>[class*="sheet"]:not([class*="body"]):not([class*="footer"]):not([class*="header"]):not([class*="mask"]):not([class*="overlay"]):not([class*="container"]){position:absolute!important;left:0!important;top:0!important;bottom:0!important;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;max-height:100%!important;display:flex!important;flex-direction:column!important;transform:none!important;animation:none!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet-body{flex:1 1 auto!important;min-height:0!important;overflow-y:auto!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-body{flex:1 1 auto!important;min-height:0!important;overflow-y:auto!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-sheet-footer{flex:0 0 auto!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="sheet"] .tf-cg-footer{flex:0 0 auto!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-frame*="bottom_bar"] .flex-1,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-frame*="button_bar"] .flex-1,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="bottom_bar"] .flex-1,.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="button_bar"] .flex-1{min-width:0!important}
.tf-component-frame>[data-component-frame*="bottom_bar"] [style*="min-width: 120"],.tf-component-frame>[data-component-frame*="button_bar"] [style*="min-width: 120"],.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="bottom_bar"] [style*="min-width: 120"],.tf-component-frame>[data-component-id*="button_bar"] [style*="min-width: 120"]{min-width:0!important}
	#tf-state-2{--tf-state-content-height:1200px;background:#f5f5f5!important;}
#tf-state-3{--tf-state-content-height:1200px;background:transparent!important;}
#tf-state-4{--tf-state-content-height:1200px;background:transparent!important;}
#tf-state-5{--tf-state-content-height:1200px;background:transparent!important;}
#tf-state-6{--tf-state-content-height:1100px;background:#f5f5f5!important;}
/* ============================================
   HarmonyOS Sans SC — 字体声明
   ============================================ */

@font-face {
  font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC';
  src: url('../assets/fonts/harmonyos-sans-sc/HarmonyOS_Sans_SC_Regular.ttf') format('truetype');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC';
  src: url('../assets/fonts/harmonyos-sans-sc/HarmonyOS_Sans_SC_Medium.ttf') format('truetype');
  font-weight: 500;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC';
  src: url('../assets/fonts/harmonyos-sans-sc/HarmonyOS_Sans_SC_Bold.ttf') format('truetype');
  font-weight: 600;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC';
  src: url('../assets/fonts/harmonyos-sans-sc/HarmonyOS_Sans_SC_Bold.ttf') format('truetype');
  font-weight: 700;
  font-display: swap;
}

/* ============================================
   kunling-o2o Design System — 主变量层
   ============================================ */

@layer base {
  :root {
    /* ── shadcn 主题变量（指向 kunling 品牌色） ── */
    --background: oklch(1 0 0);
    --foreground: var(--color-text-primary);
    --card: var(--color-bg-card);
    --card-foreground: var(--color-text-primary);
    --popover: var(--color-bg-card);
    --popover-foreground: var(--color-text-primary);
    --primary: var(--color-primary);
    --primary-foreground: var(--color-text-white);
    --secondary: var(--color-bg-hover);
    --secondary-foreground: var(--color-text-primary);
    --muted: var(--color-bg-disabled);
    --muted-foreground: var(--color-text-secondary);
    --accent: var(--color-primary-active);
    --accent-foreground: var(--color-primary);
    --destructive: var(--color-error);
    --destructive-foreground: var(--color-text-white);
    --border: var(--color-border-subtle);
    --input: var(--color-border-subtle);
    --ring: var(--color-primary);
    --radius: 0.625rem;
    --chart-1: oklch(0.87 0 0);
    --chart-2: oklch(0.556 0 0);
    --chart-3: oklch(0.439 0 0);
    --chart-4: oklch(0.371 0 0);
    --chart-5: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --sidebar: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --sidebar-foreground: var(--color-text-primary);
    --sidebar-primary: var(--color-primary);
    --sidebar-primary-foreground: var(--color-text-white);
    --sidebar-accent: var(--color-primary-active);
    --sidebar-accent-foreground: var(--color-primary);
    --sidebar-border: var(--color-border-subtle);
    --sidebar-ring: var(--color-primary);

    /* ── kunling 自定义变量 ── */
    --color-text-primary:     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    --color-text-secondary:   rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    --color-text-muted:       rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    --color-text-hint:        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    --color-text-disabled:    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    --color-text-white:       #ffffff;

    --color-primary: #C7000B;
    --color-primary-disabled: rgba(199, 0, 11, 0.4);
    --color-primary-soft: rgba(199, 0, 11, 0.05);
    --color-primary-active: rgba(199, 0, 11, 0.08);
    --color-orange: #FF8C42;

    --color-success: #10B981;
    --color-warning: #F97316;
    --color-error: #DC2626;

    --color-bg-page: #F2F3F5;
    --color-bg-card: #ffffff;
    --color-bg-hover: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    --color-bg-disabled: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);

    --color-border-subtle: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);

    --color-divider-strong:  rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    --color-divider:         rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    --color-divider-subtle:  rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    --color-divider-faint:   rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);

    --color-mask: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);

    --radius-xxs: 4px;
    --radius-md: 12px;
    --radius-lg: 16px;
    --radius-xl: 18px;
    --radius-2xl: 20px;
    --radius-3xl: 24px;
    --radius-4xl: 32px;
    --radius-full: 9999px;

    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    --shadow-lg: 0 8px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
    --shadow-xl: 0 10px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);

    --font-caption-10:  10px;
    --font-caption-12:  12px;
    --font-display-36: 36px;
    --font-display-48: 48px;
    --font-display-60: 60px;
    --font-headline-12: 12px;
    --font-headline-14: 14px;
    --font-headline-16: 16px;
    --font-headline-18: 18px;
    --font-headline-20: 20px;
    --font-headline-24: 24px;
    --font-body-12: 12px;
    --font-body-14: 14px;
    --font-body-16: 16px;

    --font-weight-regular:  400;
    --font-weight-medium:   500;
    --font-weight-semibold: 600;
    --font-weight-bold:     700;

    --line-height-12: 12px;
    --line-height-14: 14px;
    --line-height-16: 16px;
    --line-height-18: 18px;
    --line-height-20: 20px;
    --line-height-24: 24px;
    --line-height-26: 26px;
    --line-height-30: 30px;
    --line-height-32: 32px;
    --line-height-36: 36px;
    --line-height-48: 48px;
    --line-height-60: 60px;
    --line-height-64: 64px;
    --line-height-80: 80px;

    --spacing-xs: 4px;
    --spacing-sm: 6px;
    --spacing-md: 8px;
    --spacing-lg: 12px;
    --spacing-xl: 16px;
    --spacing-2xl: 24px;
  }

  .dark {
    --background: oklch(0.145 0 0);
    --foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --card: oklch(0.205 0 0);
    --card-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --popover: oklch(0.205 0 0);
    --popover-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --primary: var(--color-primary);
    --primary-foreground: var(--color-text-white);
    --secondary: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --secondary-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --muted: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --muted-foreground: oklch(0.708 0 0);
    --accent: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --accent-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --destructive: var(--color-error);
    --destructive-foreground: var(--color-text-white);
    --border: oklch(1 0 0 / 10%);
    --input: oklch(1 0 0 / 15%);
    --ring: var(--color-primary);
    --chart-1: oklch(0.87 0 0);
    --chart-2: oklch(0.556 0 0);
    --chart-3: oklch(0.439 0 0);
    --chart-4: oklch(0.371 0 0);
    --chart-5: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --sidebar: oklch(0.205 0 0);
    --sidebar-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --sidebar-primary: oklch(0.488 0.243 264.376);
    --sidebar-primary-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --sidebar-accent: oklch(0.269 0 0);
    --sidebar-accent-foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0);
    --sidebar-border: oklch(1 0 0 / 10%);
    --sidebar-ring: oklch(0.556 0 0);
  }

  * {
    @apply border-border;
    border-color: var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  body {
    @apply bg-background text-foreground;
    font-family: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-page);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }

  .theme {
    --font-heading: var(--font-sans);
    --font-sans: 'HarmonyOS Sans SC', sans-serif;
  }
  html {
    @apply font-sans;
  }
}

/* ============================================
   kunling Atomic Classes
   ============================================ */

@layer components {
  /* ── Display 字系 ── */
  .font-display-s { font-size: var(--font-display-36); line-height: var(--line-height-48); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-display-m { font-size: var(--font-display-48); line-height: var(--line-height-64); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-display-l { font-size: var(--font-display-60); line-height: var(--line-height-80); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }

  /* ── Headline 字系 ── */
  .font-headline-xxs { font-size: var(--font-headline-12); line-height: var(--line-height-16); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-xs  { font-size: var(--font-headline-14); line-height: var(--line-height-18); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-s   { font-size: var(--font-headline-16); line-height: var(--line-height-20); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-m   { font-size: var(--font-headline-18); line-height: var(--line-height-24); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-l   { font-size: var(--font-headline-20); line-height: var(--line-height-26); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-xl  { font-size: var(--font-headline-20); line-height: var(--line-height-26); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); }
  .font-headline-xxl { font-size: var(--font-headline-24); line-height: var(--line-height-32); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); }

  /* Headline 多行行高 */
  .font-headline-xs-multi { font-size: var(--font-headline-14); line-height: var(--line-height-20); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-s-multi  { font-size: var(--font-headline-16); line-height: var(--line-height-24); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-m-multi  { font-size: var(--font-headline-18); line-height: var(--line-height-26); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }
  .font-headline-l-multi  { font-size: var(--font-headline-20); line-height: var(--line-height-30); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); }

  /* ── Body 字系 ── */
  .font-body-s  { font-size: var(--font-body-12); line-height: var(--line-height-16); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-body-m  { font-size: var(--font-body-14); line-height: var(--line-height-18); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-body-l  { font-size: var(--font-body-16); line-height: var(--line-height-20); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }

  /* Body 多行行高 */
  .font-body-s-multi { font-size: var(--font-body-12); line-height: var(--line-height-18); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-body-m-multi { font-size: var(--font-body-14); line-height: var(--line-height-20); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-body-l-multi { font-size: var(--font-body-16); line-height: var(--line-height-24); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }

  /* ── Caption 字系 ── */
  .font-caption-s { font-size: var(--font-caption-10); line-height: var(--line-height-12); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-caption-m { font-size: var(--font-caption-12); line-height: var(--line-height-16); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }

  .font-caption-s-multi { font-size: var(--font-caption-10); line-height: var(--line-height-14); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }
  .font-caption-m-multi { font-size: var(--font-caption-12); line-height: var(--line-height-18); font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular); }

  /* ── Padding 类 ── */
  .p-page    { padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl); }
  .p-card    { padding: var(--spacing-lg); }
  .p-card-sm { padding: var(--spacing-md); }
  .p-pill    { padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg); }
  .p-tab     { padding: var(--spacing-xs) 0; }

  /* ── 图标容器 ── */
  .size-icon-nav   { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
  .size-icon-entry { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
  .size-icon-card  { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
  .size-icon-sm    { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
  .size-badge      { width: 16px; height: 16px; font-size: 10px; }
  .size-icon-tab   { width: 30px; height: 30px; }
  .h-banner        { height: 140px; }

  /* ── 背景渐变层 ── */
  .bg-gradient-layer-1 {
    width: 360px; height: 792px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 200px at 360px 140px, rgba(255,143,111,0.4) 0%, rgba(250,194,193,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 300px at 0px -100px, rgba(247,168,10,0.4) 0%, rgba(247,106,10,0) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f6f5 0%, #f2f3f5 100%);
  }
  .bg-gradient-layer-2 {
    width: 360px; height: 792px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 231px at 320px 0px, rgba(255,143,111,0.2) 0%, rgba(250,194,193,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 271px at 85px -105px, rgba(247,168,10,0.2) 0%, rgba(247,106,10,0) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f6f5 0%, #f2f3f5 100%);
  }
  .bg-gradient-layer-3 {
    width: 360px; height: 792px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 220px at 360px 0px, rgba(255,143,111,0.4) 0%, rgba(250,194,193,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(circle 389px at 111px -284px, rgba(247,168,10,0.4) 0%, rgba(247,106,10,0) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f6f5 0%, #f2f3f5 100%);
  }

  /* ── 交互反馈 ── */
  .tap-scale { transition: transform 150ms ease; }
  .tap-scale:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
  .tap-opacity:active { opacity: 0.8; }

  /* ── 通用 Flex ── */
  .flex-distribute { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .flex-center     { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .flex-between    { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .scrollbar-hide { scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; }
  .scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .mobile-canvas,
  .mobile-canvas * { scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; }
  .mobile-canvas::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .mobile-canvas *::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  /* ── 分割线 ── */
  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); margin: 0; }
}

/* ============================================
   Static-safe component utility layer

   These rules make the component library render correctly after React SSR in
   taskflow static HTML. They intentionally cover only the utility classes used
   by resources/components, so the generated output does not depend on a
   Tailwind runtime or build step.
   ============================================ */

.flex { display: flex; }
.inline-flex { display: inline-flex; }
.grid { display: grid; }
.block { display: block; }
.hidden { display: none; }

.flex-col { flex-direction: column; }
.flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }
.flex-shrink-0, .shrink-0 { flex-shrink: 0; }

.items-start { align-items: flex-start; }
.items-center { align-items: center; }
.items-end { align-items: flex-end; }
.items-baseline { align-items: baseline; }
.justify-center { justify-content: center; }
.justify-between { justify-content: space-between; }

.relative { position: relative; }
.absolute { position: absolute; }
.fixed { position: fixed; }
.inset-0 { inset: 0; }
.top-full { top: 100%; }
.left-0 { left: 0; }
.right-0 { right: 0; }
.top-0 { top: 0; }
.bottom-0 { bottom: 0; }
.z-10 { z-index: 10; }
.z-40 { z-index: 40; }
.z-50 { z-index: 50; }

.w-full { width: 100%; }
.h-full { height: 100%; }
.w-5 { width: 20px; }
.h-5 { height: 20px; }
.w-8 { width: 32px; }
.w-10 { width: 40px; }
.h-10 { height: 40px; }
.w-12 { width: 48px; }
.h-12 { height: 48px; }
.w-\[1px\] { width: 1px; }
.h-\[16px\] { height: 16px; }
.w-\[64px\] { width: 64px; }
.w-\[72px\] { width: 72px; }
.h-\[46px\] { height: 46px; }
.min-w-0 { min-width: 0; }

.overflow-hidden { overflow: hidden; }
.overflow-x-auto { overflow-x: auto; }
.overflow-y-auto { overflow-y: auto; }
.overflow-x-hidden { overflow-x: hidden; }

.cursor-pointer { cursor: pointer; }
.pointer-events-none { pointer-events: none; }
.border-none { border: none; }
.border-0 { border: 0; }
.border { border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); }
.border-b { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); }
.border-black { border-color: #000; }

.bg-transparent { background: transparent; }
.bg-white { background-color: #fff; }
.bg-\[var\(--color-primary\)\] { background-color: var(--color-primary); }
.bg-\[var\(--color-bg-hover\)\] { background-color: var(--color-bg-hover); }
.bg-\[var\(--color-primary-active\)\] { background-color: var(--color-primary-active); }
.text-white { color: #fff; }

.rounded-\[var\(--radius-xxs\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-xxs); }
.rounded-\[var\(--radius-md\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
.rounded-\[var\(--radius-lg\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
.rounded-\[var\(--radius-xl\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-xl); }
.rounded-\[var\(--radius-2xl\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); }
.rounded-\[var\(--radius-full\)\] { border-radius: var(--radius-full); }

.truncate { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.whitespace-nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }
.text-left { text-align: left; }
.text-center { text-align: center; }

.p-0 { padding: 0; }
.px-3 { padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; }
.px-4 { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
.py-2 { padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; }
.py-2\.5 { padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
.py-16 { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 64px; }
.pl-\[var\(--spacing-lg\)\] { padding-left: var(--spacing-lg); }
.mt-2 { margin-top: 8px; }
.mb-3 { margin-bottom: 12px; }
.-top-0\.5 { top: -2px; }
.-right-0\.5 { right: -2px; }
.left-1\/2 { left: 50%; }
.top-1\/2 { top: 50%; }
.-translate-y-1\/2 { transform: translateY(-50%); }
.rotate-180 { transform: rotate(180deg); }

.gap-0 { gap: 0; }
.gap-2 { gap: 8px; }
.gap-4 { gap: 16px; }
.grid-cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
.space-y-2 > * + * { margin-top: 8px; }

.transition-all,
.transition-colors,
.transition-opacity,
.transition-transform {
  transition-duration: 150ms;
  transition-timing-function: ease;
}
.duration-150 { transition-duration: 150ms; }
.duration-200 { transition-duration: 200ms; }
.opacity-40 { opacity: 0.4; }

.line-clamp-2 {
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* ============================================
   页面转场动画
   ============================================ */

@keyframes slide-in-right {
  from { transform: translateX(100%); }
  to   { transform: translateX(0); }
}
@keyframes slide-out-right {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to   { transform: translateX(100%); }
}
@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to   { opacity: 1; }
}
@keyframes slide-up {
  from { transform: translateY(100%); }
  to   { transform: translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes page-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to   { opacity: 1; }
}

.animate-slide-in-right { animation: slide-in-right 300ms ease-out forwards; }
.animate-slide-out-right { animation: slide-out-right 300ms ease-in forwards; }
.fade-in { animation: fade-in 300ms ease-out forwards; }
.animate-slide-up { animation: slide-up 300ms ease-out forwards; }
.animate-page-in { animation: page-in 150ms ease-out; }

/* Hide stale root-level flow components when a flow group owns their layout. */
#tf-state-2 > [data-component-id="product_info_card"],#tf-state-2 > [data-component-frame="product_info_card"]{display:none!important;visibility:hidden!important;pointer-events:none!important}
